// Coro golden of tests/fixtures/async/own/d857-slot-across-await.oir.
// D26 (#857), a V2-shaped variant of the own golden async-plain-await: after the await, a second Future of S1 is
// created in one branch. S1 is slotted, so both duties are slots, and the second slot's empty version lives across
// the await from the begin: coro saves and resumes it like any value, and both closes settle both slots.
